<title>USA: Deere &amp; Co names Orr to head fin'l services.</title>
<headline>Deere &amp; Co names Orr to head fin'l services.</headline>
<dateline>MOLINE, Ill. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deere &amp; Co said Thursday it named Michael Orr as president of its Financial Services division, effective April 1.</p>
<p>Orr, who previously served as president of John Deere Credit Co, will succeed Eugene Schotanus, Deere &amp; Co executive vice president, who is retiring.</p>
<p>Deere and its subsidiaries manufacture, distribute and finance a range of agricultural equipment.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
